s<br></li><li>Fully animated 2D cutscenes and tons of narrative to uncover.<br></li><li>The most solid soundtrack you\u2019ll ever hear in a puzzle game. No joke.<br></li><li>English, Spanish, Portuguese, Italian, German, Japanese and Korean localization</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752730/extras/fe98033b00cc224bbfb034991f41dac8.poster.avif?t=1739351013\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752730/extras/fe98033b00cc224bbfb034991f41dac8.webm?t=1739351013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752730/extras/fe98033b00cc224bbfb034991f41dac8.mp4?t=1739351013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752730/extras/51770acf4d664c86f7795385c8bbba34.poster.avif?t=1739351013\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752730/extras/51770acf4d664c86f7795385c8bbba34.webm?t=1739351013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752730/extras/51770acf4d664c86f7795385c8bbba34.mp4?t=1739351013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
